 ['f4897a29',{status:'confirmed_advisor',note:'本人 2009 Maryland 博士论文摘要首页明确 Directed By Professor Manfred Wuttig，致谢称 thesis advisor；Briber 在致谢为阶段研究指导，不误记联合论文导师。',sources:['https://api.drum.lib.umd.edu/server/api/core/bitstreams/afc83223-6f40-4645-bc75-72dae28a6bff/content','https://mse.umd.edu/news/story/mseumd-grads-the-next-generation-of-faculty-part-3']},null,'MIT 博士后指导者未明；此前人物页已记 Wuttig，修正台账滞后并继续追查。']
